cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Agricultural Economic Responses to Ecoclimate Teleconnections Induced by Forest Loss"
abstract: >-
  Code and processed results for the analysis of how large-scale forest loss and
  C3 grass replacement in 14 U.S. NEON regions affect crop yields, land
  allocation, prices and agricultural welfare, linking CESM2 climate simulations
  to econometric crop-yield models and the FASOM agricultural sector model.
